cngpt is a C translation of nanoGPT by Andrej Karpathy
(https://github.com/karpathy/nanoGPT).

The architecture, training loop design, and AdamW hyperparameters follow
nanoGPT closely. The weight file format, BLAS tensor primitives, and GNU
packaging are original to this project.

Maintainer:
  David Mulryan
